<title>GERMANY: Riedel-de-Haen, AlliedSignal integration way clear.</title>
<headline>Riedel-de-Haen, AlliedSignal integration way clear.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>German chemicals group Riedel-de-Haen AG said on Friday that there were no obstacles to its integration into AlliedSignal Holding AG, the group said in a regulatory statement.</p>
<p>The group added that shareholders were to receive 2,500 marks per 100 mark share as part of the integration.</p>
<p>Earlier in the day, the share was suspended from dealings.</p>
</text>
